\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0   As the deer longs for cool
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 water so my soul longs
\par for Thee O my Lord,
\par Like the sails set for home
\par and freedom, on journey,
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par to heaven onward.
\par In the Kingdom of the Lord
\par You've  revealed yourself  to mankind.
\par I will look for Thee too!
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  Nothing do I have in
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0 Heaven and on this earth
\par than the bread of life
\par Everlasting peace and
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par comforter of my soul Jesus Christ my  Lord
\par You have selflessly laid down
\par Your life for the sick and weary
\par \pard   and have made our refuge.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

